D3D11CreateDevice -> 0x00000000
CreateComputeShader -> 0x00000000
dispatch-update-dispatch: first sees old=yes (mismatch 0 of 1024), second sees new (mismatch 0 of 1024)
dispatch-copy-dispatch: first sees old=yes (mismatch 0 of 1024), second sees new (mismatch 0 of 1024)
dispatch-region-dispatch: first sees old=yes (mismatch 0 of 1024), second half-new (mismatch 0 of 1024)
